    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\nSherry FitzGerald O' Reilly are delighted to welcome you to 10 Oak Park Avenue, an elegant 3 bedroomed mid-terrace home in this attractive Cairn homes built estate. This is a light filled, superbly spacious home in a highly sought-after and well maintained development. It features the latest in home-energy efficiencies and top quality fixtures and fittings.The well-proportioned accommodation in this fine property briefly comprises entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, guest wc, utility room. Upstairs landing, 3 bedrooms (main en-suite) and family bathroom. Number 10 is conveniently situated within a short walk of Naas town centre, shops, many schools, hospital, lakeside walks and sporting facilities. It offers easy access to the M7/N7 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \nBright welcoming hallway with cloakroom off.\n\nLiving Room - 4.65m x 4.00m\nSpacious and bright front room with excellent natural light and laminate wooden floor.\n\nGuest WC - 1.65m x 1.50m\nWith tiled floor, wc, wall mounted wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 8.45m x 2.60m\nA stylish range of modern contemporary wall and floor units incorporating an integrated oven, gas hob, extractor fan, fridge-freezer, and dishwasher. There is a generous dining area with French doors leading to the rear garden. The is laminate wood flooring throughout.\n\nUtility Room - 3.05m x 2.35m\nThe utility includes a washer/dryer, storage shelves and a laminate wood floor.\n\nLanding - \nWith carpet flooring and attic access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.20m x 4.25m\nThis is a very generous double bedroom filled with natural light. It is fitted with floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes and a laminate wooden floor.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.15m x 1.65m\nThe en-suite is fully tiled, with wc, wash hand basin and large shower unit. With heated towel ladder rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.00m x 2.85m\nThis spacious double room with view of the rear garden includes fitted wardrobes and laminate wooden floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.00m x 2.20m\nBedroom 3 is a double room with laminate wooden floor.\n\nBathroom - 3.05m x 1.70m\nThe bathroom is fully tiled, with wc, wash hand basin, shower unit with fitted door, heated towel rail and bath.\n\nOutside - \nSpacious cobblelock driveway to the front. Rear garden laid in lawn."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Built circa 2019.</li><li>Extends to 115m2 approximately.</li><li>Homebond warranty.</li><li>Gas fired heating.</li><li>High performance double glazed windows.</li><li>PV solar panels.</li><li>High levels of airtight insulation.</li><li>Carpets, blinds and integrated kitchen appliances included.</li><li>Wonderful 14 acre Park with playground and walking trails.</li><li>Creche on site with day care and after school options.</li><li>Contemporary sanitary ware and fittings in all bathrooms.</li><li>Off street parking for two cars on cobble lock drive.</li><li>uPvc Soffit and fascia.</li><li>20 minutes' walk to three primary schools, with secondary schools also in walking distance.</li><li>Close to Naas town centre with its many restaurants, bars, boutiques and leisure facilities.</li><li>Easy access to M7/N7 junction and the Arrow commuter train is available in nearby Sallins.</li></ul>"
      },
